prompts.py holds prompt text from A-EVO-Lab/a-evolve (https://github.com/A-EVO-Lab/a-evolve, branch release/evo-harness,
commit 3c7c7b8c62a3f07da1d4407aa03f0ca079954bcf): evo_harness/terminal_bench.py's ANALYZE_AND_PROPOSE_FAIL_PROMPT
verbatim, CURATOR_PROMPT and GENERAL_CURATOR_PROMPT with the word "terminal" taken out, and the lazy-load skill list's
text of evo_harness/swe_bench.py's build_system_prompt adapted. evolver.py reimplements, function by function,
evo_harness/swe_bench.py's _extract_trajectory_signals, _format_signals, _parse_proposal, _curate_topic_proposals,
_execute_topic_curation, _curate_general_skills, _execute_general_curation and evolve_batch. The Evo-Harness code is
